This package contains rules derived from OpenAI Codex
(https://github.com/openai/codex), codex-rs/apply-patch at tag rust-v0.158.0:
the patch grammar and its parser rules (parser.rs), the matching passes of
seek_sequence (seek_sequence.rs), and the replacement rules of
compute_replacements (lib.rs), together with the messages they report.

